格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Per-model LLM call rate limiter for DeepSeek Harness with queue/reject support and interactive GUI configuration.","id":"gh:1367456365","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-llm-rate-limiter","slug":"Leafyezi233/dsh-llm-rate-limiter","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Per-model LLM call rate limiter for DeepSeek Harness with queue/reject support and interactive GUI c"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" call rate limiter for DeepSeek Harness with queue/reject support and interactive GUI configuration."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-llm-rate-limiter"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Per-model LLM call rate limiter for DeepSeek Harness with queue/reject support and interactive GUI c"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" call rate limiter for DeepSeek Harness with queue/reject support and interactive GUI configuration."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Per-model rate limiting** — independent concurrency, RPM, and burst limits for each `provider/mo"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"del`\n- **Two algorithms** — Token Bucket (allows bursts) or Sliding Window (smooth, strict RPM)\n- **"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"Queue mode** — throttled requests wait in queue and are released when a slot opens\n- **Reject mode**"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" — throttled requests fail immediately (integrates with `dsh-llm-retry` for auto-backoff)\n- **Intera"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ctive GUI** — collapsible card in DSH Settings → Plugins → Configurable\n- **Live status panel** — re"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"al-time counters, per-model progress bars and an event log (v0.2.0)\n- **Hot-reload** — settings chan"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ges take effect immediately, no restart needed\n- **Every request checked** — intercepts `llm/stream`"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" waterfall, covering every LLM call in every agent turn"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Status Panel (v0.2.0)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Expanding the card shows a live panel at the top of its body:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Aspect | Behaviour |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Data channel | Channel `/llm-rate-limiter` — authenticated (401/403 fence), POST+JSON, auto-cleane"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d with the plugin fiber |\n| Carrier | Prefers the framework's `connection.rpc.handle()`; falls back "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"to a self-registered prefix route that reuses `connection.requestRejection()` when the framework pat"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"h is broken (see below) |\n| Cadence | 1 s polling while the card is expanded; backs off 2 s → 4 s → "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"8 s after failures |\n| Collapsed card | The panel unmounts, so **no polling runs at all** |\n| Endpoi"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"nts | `snapshot` (live counters) and `reset` (zero the statistics) |\n| Without a channel | Shows \"状态"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"通道不可用\" and leaves the rest of the card fully functional |\n| Counters | `requests` / `granted` / `rej"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"ected` / `timeouts` / `aborted` / `totalWaitMs`, plus the last 8 events (ring buffer of 64) |\n| Prog"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"ress bars | Token bucket shows `tokens/burstSize`; sliding window shows `countInWindow/maxRpm`; both"},{"id":"p11s10","text":" turn amber as the limit approaches |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Carrier fallback (DSH 0.1.5-rc.3 onward)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"DSH 0.1.5-rc.3 changed `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection`'s own `inject` from\n`[\"webServer\", \"cred"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"entials\"]` to `[\"credentials\"]`, but its\n`HostConnectionService.register()` still dereferences `owne"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"r.webServer`.\nCordis rebinds a cross-fiber service's `ctx` to the *reader's* fiber, so\n`connection.r"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"pc.handle()` throws: **still present in 0.1.7-rc.1** — see below."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The plugin now detects that and mounts the same channel itself:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Path | When | How |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 1 (preferred) | `connection.rpc.handle()` works | The framework owns the route, request validation"},{"id":"p17s2","text":", and fiber-scoped withdrawal |\n| 2 (fallback) | Path 1 throws | The plugin registers a `kind: \"pref"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ix\"` route on its own fiber (which *can* see `webServer`) and reuses `connection.requestRejection()`"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" for the 403/401 fence |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Both carriers speak the identical wire protocol, so **the browser half is\nunchanged** — the panel ca"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nnot tell which one is live. If\n`connection.requestRejection()` is unavailable, the plugin refuses t"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"o mount\nrather than publishing an unauthenticated route."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Option 1: npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Option 2: local path (development)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"> The plugin must be added as a dependency in the profile's `package.json`.\n> The bundle entry (`cor"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"dis.patch.yml`) is auto-detected by `reconcilePlugins`.\n>\n> **0.3.0 requires DSH 0.1.7-rc.1 or newer"},{"id":"p24s3","text":".** Pin `@leaf233/dsh-llm-rate-limiter@0.2.x`\n> for DSH 0.1.5. See the compatibility table."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Option 3: from GitHub"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Important**: Git-hosted plugins are blocked by pnpm's `allowBuilds` restriction on first inst"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"all. If the install fails, check the error message for the exact key pnpm suggests, then add it to y"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"our profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":">\n> Then re-run the install command."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Via GUI"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"1. Open DSH Web UI (`dsh web`)\n2. Go to **Settings → Plugins** and open the **Official** group\n3. Fi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"nd the **LLM 调用限速** card (`data-plugin-item=\"llm-rate-limiter\"`) and open it\n4. Configure defaults, "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"per-model overrides, and throttle behavior — changes save\nthrough the page's own form, so the live s"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"tatus panel is right there"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> The card lives in the **Official** group because DSH lists every `plugins.item`\n> registrant there"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"; the plugin's order is `900`, so it follows the five official\n> settings pages."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Via file"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Changes persist into the profile's Cordis patch, in the entry's own `config`\n(0.1.7 reads configurat"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ion from the entry's exported `Config`; a legacy\n`settings.yaml` is imported by DSH once at first st"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"art and then renamed). The shape is:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Settings Reference"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | Global on/off switch. When off, zero overhead bypass. |\n| `strategy` | `\"toke"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"n-bucket\"` | `\"token-bucket\"` (allows bursts) or `\"sliding-window\"` (smooth, strict RPM) |\n| `defaul"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ts.maxConcurrent` | `5` | Max simultaneous requests per model |\n| `defaults.maxRpm` | `60` | Max req"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"uests per minute per model |\n| `defaults.burstSize` | `10` | Token bucket capacity — how many reques"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"ts can burst at once |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| DSH Version | Plugin version | Status | Notes |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| 0.1.2-rc.1 | 0.2.x | ✅ Tested | Original target; `connection.rpc` carrier |\n| 0.1.5-rc.3 | 0.2.x |"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" ✅ Tested | Requires the carrier fallback; verified over real HTTP |\n| **0.1.7-rc.1+** | **0.3.x** |"},{"id":"p43s3","text":" ✅ **Tested** | **`settingsScope` → `configForms`; `settings.plugin.item` → `plugins.item`; Config-b"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"ased settings** |\n| 0.2.x (DSH) | — | ⚠️ Untested | May need API adjustments |\n| Cordis 5+ | — | ⚠️ "},{"id":"p43s5","text":"Untested | Major version change likely requires rewrite |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
